    ],
    bottomLine: "The curved trainer to buy on Amazon if you want what the AssaultRunner Pro does, plus resistance for sled-style pushes, and are under 330 lb.",
    description: "The AssaultRunner Pro is sold through Assault Fitness and its dealers rather than on Amazon US, so this card shows the nearest curved trainer that Amazon does sell. The C80 is a self-powered curved deck, like the Pro, with a magnetic brake added. The figures cross-checked on this site in October 2026 give it a 62 by 19-inch slat belt, eight magnetic resistance levels, a 330 lb maximum user weight and a 261 lb machine weight, and its Bluetooth console connects to SOLE’s own app and third-party platforms. Its warranty is lifetime on the frame and one year on the deck, parts, electronics and labour. Against the Pro, it matches the running length, adds width and resistance, and costs less; it gives up 20 lb of user rating and the Pro’s longer moving-parts and belt cover. SOLE listed it at $2,399.99 on 5 November 2026; check the Amazon price on the day.",
  },
