        commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Learn more about how we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#sole-c80-curved-manual-treadmill"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31bmqOOpE8L._SL500_.jpg" alt="SOLE C80 Curved Manual Treadmill" width="500" height="333" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>SOLE C80 Curved Manual Treadmill</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          A curved treadmill has no motor and no speed buttons. You run on a slatted belt that sits
