          about the machine.
        </aside>

        <nav class="ed-toc not-prose" aria-label="In this guide">
          <h2>In this guide</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#short-answer">AssaultRunner Pro Treadmill: The Short Answer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how-it-works">How a Curved, Motorless Treadmill Works</a></li>
            <li><a href="#specifications">The Specifications, and Where Sources Disagree</a></li>
            <li><a href="#deck-and-running">The Running Surface: Width, Feel and the Learning Curve</a></li>
            <li><a href="#console">The Console and Connectivity</a></li>
            <li><a href="#workouts">What It Is Best For: Sprints, Intervals and Conditioning</a></li>
            <li><a href="#warranty-and-stock">Warranty, Price and Stock</a></li>
            <li><a href="#space-and-delivery">Space, Delivery and Moving It</a></li>
            <li><a href="#classic-and-elite">AssaultRunner Pro vs Classic and Elite</a></li>
            <li><a href="#alternatives">Alternatives Worth Comparing</a></li>
